Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们以吃人为生  名叫圭布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}man-eating predators called Graboids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我利用我对本地的认识  直觉和炮火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Using a combination of local knowledge, intuition and firepower,
