Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:35.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将丑陋的生物变为美餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it rears its ugly head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, let's review.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用50分钟搭建起这土炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took me 50 minutes to build this improvised clay oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,32分钟来生火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-two minutes to fire up the scrub wood,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加热内部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heat the interior,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将蛇放进去并封好口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feed in that snake and seal the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们就等他们  变为美食佳肴吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we wait as this little baby turns snake into snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很热  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And voilá!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热辣辣  美味多汁  富含蛋白质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One sizzling, succulent piece of pure protein.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后加入毕的劲好味牌  仙人掌汁腌料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can bet that Burt's Bullseye Brand Cactus Juice Marinade
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令这变得更惹味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will eradicate any trace of that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:10.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保证不会像鸡肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"tastes like chicken" residue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.59,0:10:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈是谁  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yowza!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.53,0:10:24.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闻起来像鸡肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smells like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神秘的传奇人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man, the myth, the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕甘默  我是卓华斯韦加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burt effing Gummer. Travis B. Welker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  先生  我该早些通知你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, sir. I should've told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无意跟踪你  但我是你忠实拥护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mean to be all stalkery, but I've been a big fan of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从看了你2000年的阴谋论剧集起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since your Y2K conspiracy series.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以收工了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess that's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:45.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要擅离职守  莱利  还没到休息时闲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maintain position, Riley. It's not Miller Time, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all yours, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的设备在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your gear's piled over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢那工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thanks for the Vegas gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么工作  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What Vegas gig?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.06,0:10:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉斯维加斯娇妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Real Housewives of Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能这样抛下我  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't just adiós on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:11:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是工会的工作  有退休金和医保  所以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a union gig, pension and health. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你新的摄影师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is your new camera guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他口碑很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, well, he comes highly recommended.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经验丰富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of time in the eyepiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你擅离职守  老友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're officially AWOL, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:12.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你没看过我履历  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I take it he didn't give you my resume?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I got something for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:18.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的数码履历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is called a digital file.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能充分展现我的实力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna speak to my awesome capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.19,0:11:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望你的网页也能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of wish your website could do the same for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.59,0:11:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的拥护  可能是最忠实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a big fan. You know, possibly your biggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你置身内华达州  这个无人关心的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the fact that you're out here in Who-The-Hell-Cares, Nevada,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处是响尾蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}smokin' rattlesnake says something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知这说明什么吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it says?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你埋没了自己  老友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says you're underachieving big time, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该成为全球品牌  来吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be a global brand. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:46.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识几个怪兽猎人  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, how many monster-hunters do you know? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只认识一个  毕甘默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know one. Burt Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有多少个Twitter关注者  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last check, how many Twitter followers did you have, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zilch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的好意我心领了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your opinion is duly noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:12:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来这里就是为了  帮你打造毕甘默的品牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what I'm here for. To help build out the Burt Gummer brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这名字如何  "多疑独行侠遇上魅力神经刀"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking, "Paranoid loner meets charming whack job."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你解决问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can fix you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要人解决问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need fixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么问题  老友  看太多《绝命毒师》  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, what happened to your dome, my man? You binge watch Breaking Bad, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.07,0:12:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要吸引年轻观众群  就要加入饶舌音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trying to appeal to a younger demographic, get a little Pitbull on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有什么问题与你无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I choose to do with my cranium is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.41,0:12:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是蛇对吧  不是老鼠  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is snake, right, not rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:34.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真惹味  甘默出品  必属佳品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a win. That's a yummer from The Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该暍瓶啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, you look like you could use a cold one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要  你呢  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I can. You want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们相处融洽  对不对  老爹  你感觉到吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I think we're vibing right now, right, Pop? You feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈得很投契  你的啤酒呢  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good talk. Where's your beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要碰我的装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands off my gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松点  老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lighten up, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是政府的人  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You from the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  佛州人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.08,0:12:56.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在墨西哥湾沿岸长大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grew up on the Gulf Coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:13:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴拿马城  坦帕  彭萨科拉海湾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Panama City, Trampa, Pensacola.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 彭萨科拉  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pensacola? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有个不错的枪展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got a great gun show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.73,0:13:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  就在洲际公路旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right off the Interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:08.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我74年去过那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was there in '74.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看出什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What look?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在佛罗里达做过一些  见不得光的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "I did some dirty things in Florida" look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白  那是70年代  爱情自由  你还年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I get it. It was the '70s, free love, you were young.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在怎样  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.48,0:13:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来税局终于找上门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like the IRS finally caught up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘默先生  甘默先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gummer. Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你简直神出鬼没  先生  实在太难找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are way off grid, sir, you're a very difficult man to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.56,0:13:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然还不够难找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evidently, not difficult enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫艾力云韦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Erich Van Wyk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自南非野生动物部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with the South African Wildlife Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南非  你是政府的人  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South Africa? You with the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  不  我是你拥护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No, no. I'm a big fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:14:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在豪登目前处于危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we have a rather pressing situation in Gauteng.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豪登  人类的摇篮  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gauteng. The Cradle of Humankind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:10.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们确认目击到  你称为艾巴的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a confirmed sighting of what you would refer to as an Ass Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.96,0:14:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不可能  这种生物  只在北半球出没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible. The species are confined to the Northern Hemisphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种正在南非造成恐慌的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, then, I suppose it's some other flying carnivore
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是一种屁股喷火  而且会飞的食肉兽  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that shoots flame out of its rear end that we have wreaking havoc in Africa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们确定有人看到  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a confirmed sighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  先生  但目击者已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, sir. Although the witness is no longer alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们何时出发  - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When do we leave? - Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着  亚甘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow your roll, there, Gums. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这非洲人真会说话  云迪先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're quite the fetching bushman, Mr. Van Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是云韦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Van Wyk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,云韦  好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Van Wyk, right, okay. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘默先生不再涉足怪物界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gummer really isn't in the monster business, anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能和他谈谈吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us a minute, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.61,0:14:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要从这人身上捞些好处  好处  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working this dude for some paper. Paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱  听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cash. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能接受第一次开价  我帮你讨价还价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't take the first offer. Let me close this deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒绝  我独自工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Request denied. I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你需要一个摄影师  对吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, but you need a videographer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:11.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要看长远些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to take the long view on this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.55,0:15:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想想  甘默在非洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it. The Gummer in Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个好机会  将你  做的事记录在影带上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our chance to catch you on tape really doing what you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.59,0:15:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你如何对付艾巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and really giving it to those Ass Blasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.70,0:15:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂我意思吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that came out weird, but you know what I mean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世界很残酷  你只是新人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is real world, son. You're a newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新人  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:31.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要扮大哥  听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, stop being Burt for a second, and just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:34.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能没花半辈子时闲  和巨型怪兽搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may have not spent most of my life fighting giant, blind worms,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我过去10年都身处危险区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I spent the last 10 years of my life deep in the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮国际新闻网络和霍士电视  在沙漠上拍片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulling gigs for CNN and Fox in the sandbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去过阿富汗  叙利亚  你知道那些地方吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Afghanistan, Syria. You know those places?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.49,0:15:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:48.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as for firearms,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我新入手这宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just added this baby to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,HK  91\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}HK 91.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你从哪里得来的 - 啊啊啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you get that? - Uh-uh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你批准我跟你去南非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You punch my ticket to South Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.47,0:16:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我便亲手奉上  这漂亮的半自动机关枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and will I hand over this beautiful, semi-automatic Mr. Shotty to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾力  我能叫你艾力吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erich. May I call you Erich?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.55,0:16:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很感谢你的邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We really appreciate your offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但甘默先生打怪兽的日程  已经订满了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Mr. Gummer's monster-hunting schedule's all booked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, uh... That's a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到奥扎克打大脚怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bigfoot in the Ozarks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到弗雷斯诺打妖精\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possible gremlin in Fresno.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说在秘鲁还有狼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family of werewolves in Peru we heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰你们了  两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for your time, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.85,0:16:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我想这不会  改变你们的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose it would make any difference
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果我提出赞助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I offered to fully fund
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:17:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘默先生未来两年的影片拍摄呢  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gummer's videos for the next two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,航班何时飞  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time does your plane leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们多快能收拾好  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How quickly can you roll your tents?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rolled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:16.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕甘默要来南非了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burt Gummer. In Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.11,0:17:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非洲不是胆小鬼来的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Africa's not for sissies, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们吃自己捕杀的猎物  兄台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We eat what we kill here, boet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能叫你兄台吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mind if I call you boet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄台  就是兄弟的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boet? Yeah. It means brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怪兽猎人  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're the monster-hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, somethin' like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不像我之前见过的艾巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't look like any Ass Blaster I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 莫名吸引  - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Strange attraction. - Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个猎杀怪兽的男人  具有莫名的吸引力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man who hunts a monster. It's a strange attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比维先生  你醉了  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bravers, are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘默先生  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gummer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去河南岸  一间野生动物园木屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're heading for a safari lodge, just south of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.45,0:18:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屋主很慷慨地让我们  将那里作为行动基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The owner's been kind enough to let us base our operations there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唏  我从美国带来的装备和武器呢  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where's my bug-out bag and the weapons I brought from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南非的入境条例非常严格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have very strict customs laws here in South Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该提醒你  枪械要经过三天检疫隔离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have warned you about the three-day weapons quarantine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三天什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three-day what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  我准备了一批武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it. I've procured us some weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:50.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在木屋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're waiting for us at the lodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.64,0:18:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, there it is, there, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.82,0:19:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(摇篮石保护区)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.39,0:19:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(马利斯山脉)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好  云戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice digs, Van Dyke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是云韦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Van Wyk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 唏  兄台  - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, boet. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要告诉你一个故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a story for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在非洲  每天早上  当一只蹬羚醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every morning in Africa, a gazelle wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知自己要跑得比最快的狮子快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he knows he's gotta run faster than the fastest lion,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会被杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天早上  一只狮子醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every morning, a lion wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他都知自己要跑得  比最慢的蹬羚快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he knows he's gotta outrun the slowest gazelle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则他会饿死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise he's gonna starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:58.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此不管你是狮子还是蹬羚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, it doesn't matter if you are a lion or you're a gazelle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在非洲  每当太阳升起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Africa, when the sun rises,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就要跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you better be running.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唏  如果你需要帮忙  吹这号角找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, if you need my help, call me on the horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你保重  兄台  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, you go well, boet. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.90,0:20:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chop-chop, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再叫我"老爹"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop calling me "Pops."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们安全了  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.95,0:20:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个震波监测仪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a seismic vibration monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和南非国家地震网互联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's uplinked to the South African National Grid of Seismology
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.09,0:20:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能探测到80公里范围内  圭布的移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and can detect Graboid movement within a 50 square-mile area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next level type stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圭布  大虫  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Graboid? Worms? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是庄拿德亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Johan Dreyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的地方代表人及  该区的野生动物园导游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my local field representative and a safari guide in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是致命袭击的目击者之一  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the one who witnessed the fatal attack. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.97,0:21:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这一大块朱古力是我助手塔巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this towering hunk of dark chocolate is my assistant, Thaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这枪真犀利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's quite a gun you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定令你觉得自己充满力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bet it makes you feel like you got a lot of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以在100米外打死一只犀牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can drop a charging rhino at 100 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想试吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna go for a run?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是冲锋飞车队的  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's life in the Thunderdome?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.72,0:21:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犀牛用角刺穿你的喉咙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you wouldn't know what a rhino looked like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不知他长什么样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it shoved its horn through your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.66,0:21:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何已知的镇静剂  对圭布和艾巴都不起作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Graboids and Ass Blasters are immune to any known form of tranquilizer,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:31.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们正追捕的生物  一般的武器毫无用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rendering your weapon useless against the creatures we're hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们计划活捉他们吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capturing. Capturing, that's the plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能活捉他们  只能猎杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't capture these things. You kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死  活捉  我不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them, capture them, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们非洲没有圭布  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what we have in Africa, sir, is not Graboids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们有艾巴  就有圭布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you've got Ass Blasters, you've got Graboids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(普华斯湖挖掘点)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(豪登省)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.47,0:22:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有齿生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odontotermes baadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.04,0:22:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但体型庞大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But on a massive scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.51,0:22:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有同样的镁下牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has the same magnesium mandibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.48,0:22:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解释了基岩附近为何有蚁酸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That explains the presence of formic acid in the bedrock surrounding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.35,0:22:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他吐出酸  软化岩石  下牙就能皎穿它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It spits out the acid to soften the rocks, while the mandibles chew through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是超级挖掘兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a super digger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会上《科学》杂志封面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to be on the cover of Science magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上过了  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been there, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.53,0:22:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要上《国家地理杂志》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want National Geographic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.31,0:23:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘默先生  甘默先生  这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gummer. Mr. Gummer. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真爽  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you say, "Ballin'"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.95,0:23:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祖鲁语"爽"怎么说  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's the Zulu word for "Ballin'"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.89,0:23:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  巴鲁提  带孩子们去散步  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Baruti. Taking the kids for a walk, I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些年轻女士太高贵  看不上你这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know that these young ladies
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.43,0:23:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总得有人来做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are too high-class for the likes of you, so, I guess somebody has to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just act natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.73,0:23:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是来调查闪电鸟袭击的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These men are here investigating the impundulu attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪兽猎人  对吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, right, the monster-hunters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.81,0:23:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧  我还在培训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ish. I'm still in training, but I got, like, a credit away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要枪  亚毕  这就是我们的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want guns, Burt? This is how we roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.52,0:24:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.66,0:24:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.03,0:24:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.50,0:24:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要的枪炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The weapons you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.67,0:24:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一支BSA  303和一支  30-06  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A BSA .303 and a .30-06?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.44,0:24:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一支柯尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's also a Colt Peacemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和一支...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.91,0:24:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双枪管长枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh! The double-barrel thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.41,0:24:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧  我们还得  用锯将它分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you serious? We might as well use a spit straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.45,0:24:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有请求都会获批\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted, it's not everything you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.98,0:24:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我只要被你们的  慈居政府爪牙没收的枪械\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, what I requested was confiscated by your mindless government lackeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.15,0:24:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.79,0:24:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会向每个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't just hand out machine guns
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.42,0:24:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这国家的驯兽师发机关枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to every jacked-up safari jockey that comes to this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.76,0:24:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是非洲  甘默先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Africa, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.03,0:24:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们不全是野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're not all bushies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.70,0:24:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是种族歧视吗  听起来像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that racist? That sounded a little racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.17,0:24:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原始人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bushist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你答应会给我足够的枪械\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised me adequate weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.34,0:24:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我们在追捕什么  会飞的松鼠仔  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think we're hunting, Rocky, the flying squirrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:24:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,30-06能打倒非洲任何生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That .30-06 will drop anything on this continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.11,0:25:01.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.08,0:25:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是谁  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.95,0:25:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唏  嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电死虫子做饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zapping worms for bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.15,0:25:16.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.83,0:25:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.93,0:25:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有芥辣吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got any wasabi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.16,0:25:25.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.03,0:25:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 吃  - 这是非洲传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eat it? - Eat it. African tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.38,0:25:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是非洲传统  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it really African tradition?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.18,0:25:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 噢  老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.95,0:25:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卓华斯  卓华斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travis, Travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.85,0:25:49.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是娜蒂莫塔布医生  这保护区属于她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Dr. Nandi Montabu. She owns the reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.46,0:25:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  医生  娜蒂就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doctor. Nandi is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  有免费无线上网和咖啡店才叫好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, free Wi-Fi at a coffee shop is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就像假日饮品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are like a holiday drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.00,0:25:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像一杯焦糖玛琪雅朵南瓜味拿铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a caramel macchiato pumpkin spice latte,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.97,0:26:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了你不是南瓜味  是非洲香料味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but instead of pumpkin, it's African spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.24,0:26:06.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  听来很美味  谢谢  你一定是卓华斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well, sounds delicious. Thank you. You must be Travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.61,0:26:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松点  韦加先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease, Mr. Welker.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.58,0:26:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘默先生  欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gummer, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:12.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在木屋后为你们  准备了一些点心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... I've arranged some refreshments for you back at the lodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.78,0:26:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 非常感谢  医生... - 是娜蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With all due respect, Doctor... - It's Nandi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.75,0:26:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜蒂  我想我们  该马上出发捕猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nandi, I think we should get right to the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.92,0:26:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先休息  甘默先生  明早才行动  好吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's rest up, Mr. Gummer. Start fresh in the morning, yes?
