Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.13,0:26:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卓华斯  你吃了那些虫子吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travis, did you eat the worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.93,0:27:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.90,0:27:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.74,0:27:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.04,0:27:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌回到现实世界  对着那些吸毒上脑的学生讲课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I hate to go back to the real world and lecture at stoned-out students.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能留在这丛林里  和你一起真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be nice to stay out here in the bush, with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.18,0:27:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望这一刻能永远持续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish this moment would last the rest of my life.
