Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.97,0:28:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实地通讯呢  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about field communications?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么  - 猴子婚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell was that? - A monkey's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.35,0:28:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本地的说法  太阳雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Local lingo. Sun shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.62,0:28:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每年这个时候  每天同一时闲都会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get them every day, at this time of the year, at the exact same hour.
