Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.35,0:28:35.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午3点  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1500 hours. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.72,0:28:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大自然母亲有她的节律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother Nature keeps to her rhythms.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.79,0:28:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫塔布医生  娜蒂  怎么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Montabu. Nandi? Yes?
