Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.33,0:29:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾巴绝对不会这样做  云韦先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Ass Blaster definitely didn't do this, Mr. Van Wyk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.98,0:30:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唏  亚甘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Gums.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.58,0:30:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也许想看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may wanna check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.09,0:30:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢材要付出血的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're dumb, you bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.83,0:30:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的问题比我想象中严重  云韦先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your problem is bigger than I thought, Mr. Van Wyk.
