Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.47,0:30:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这圭布比美国的大得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Graboid is much larger than the North American variety.
