Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.82,0:30:43.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有什么惊喜给我  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What other surprises do you have in store for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.85,0:30:45.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在学习中  甘默先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm learning as I go, Mr. Gummer.
