Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.55,0:31:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  亚甘  我明了  你喜欢和枪保持亲密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez, Gummy-drops, we get it. You like to get cozy with your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.76,0:31:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是亲密  韦加先生  是人枪合一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just cozy, Mr. Welker. Conjoined.
