Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.70,0:31:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南非野生动物联盟  为何这样问  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South African Wildlife Federation. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.67,0:31:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.30,0:31:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.24,0:31:36.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要兜风吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.47,0:31:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我们那边见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'll see you over there.
