Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.61,0:31:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她邀请我参加一个部落跳舞集会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she invited me to some tribal dance thing.
