Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.55,0:31:50.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着  你对我实行宵禁  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Are you giving me a curfew?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.28,0:31:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不守宵禁  老爹  我是成年人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't do curfews, Pops. Okay? I'm an adult.
