Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.64,0:32:42.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.04,0:32:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唏  唏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.58,0:32:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来了  - 哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You made it. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.72,0:32:57.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真热闹  是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is quite the rager. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.62,0:33:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们有酒吗  - 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You guys got a keg? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.56,0:33:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.49,0:33:07.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么  - 勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this? - Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.60,0:33:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.87,0:33:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝起来像牛尿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tastes like cow piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.61,0:33:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还要吗  再来一口  - 我不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want more? Try again. - No, I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.18,0:33:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斗士舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a warrior dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.61,0:33:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的祖先猎杀巨蚌和闪电鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ancestors hunting the Inkanyamba and the impundulu.
