Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:34.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪电鸟  你们称之为艾巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impundulu. It's what you call the Ass Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.09,0:33:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾巴  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ass Blaster. - Yes.
