Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.09,0:33:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让艾巴听起来还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you know, you make Ass Blaster sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.10,0:33:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔巴  我信不过那两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Thaba, I'm really not sure about these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.07,0:33:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是那个卓华斯  我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially this Travis guy. I mean...
