Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是你的吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she your Nandi, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.54,0:33:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可以是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, she could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.61,0:33:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运  老友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck with that, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.61,0:33:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以发梦吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A guy can dream, right?
