Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.82,0:34:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几百瓶  老友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hundreds, boet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.61,0:34:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.33,0:34:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.24,0:35:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.38,0:35:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们称之为艾巴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you call the Ass Blaster, in our language,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.71,0:35:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们的语言里  意思是"燃烧鸟"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the word means "lightning bird."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.62,0:35:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪电鸟是夜闲猎食者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The impundulu are nocturnal hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.89,0:35:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们前额有生物感应器  倚靠热能感应捕猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have bio-sensors on their foreheads and their hunt is based on heat signatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.69,0:35:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们白天捕猎时  定位不大准确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they hunt during the day, their targeting might be confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.06,0:35:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么那些怪兽夜闲出没  在较低温度下捕猎  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, those freaks come out at night, so they can hunt their prey in cooler temps?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.83,0:35:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  他们就像吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they're like vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.06,0:36:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  不  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
