Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.14,0:37:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起给美国人做保姆  我有更好的事情要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have better things to do than babysit Americans in Africa.
