Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.01,0:39:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他和我一起  - 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was with me. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.51,0:39:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要提醒你  医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here's some intel for you, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.08,0:39:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些喷火怪已闯入你的保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those fart-flaming sons of bitches have crossed your DMZ.
