Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.82,0:39:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好你在  甘默先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God you're here, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.02,0:39:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装上子弹  我们去追捕他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, load every gun. We're going after them.
