Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.17,0:39:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一  永远不要这样碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number one, don't ever touch me like that again.
