Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.58,0:40:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪里得来的  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.01,0:40:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.58,0:40:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like your style. A-frickin'-men.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.18,0:40:47.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个兽医为何会有一支机关枪  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a veterinarian doing with a machine gun?
