Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.13,0:41:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们混合肠胃中几种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They mix several volatile gastrointestinal chemicals
