Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.49,0:41:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  关掉引擎  我们去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Take it ahead and kill the engine. We'll have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.31,0:41:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然有备而来  甘默先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure do come prepared, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.81,0:41:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比臣是在悬崖对面的平地被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Basson was killed on that koppie, just underneath that cliff face.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.31,0:41:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们找到艾巴的聚居地了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we have our Ass Blaster colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.05,0:41:51.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诱饵呢  我们是否要加热它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the bait? Don't we need to make it hot
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.88,0:41:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让艾巴看见  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so these bastards can see it?
