Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.23,0:42:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.93,0:42:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  解开笼子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, unhook the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.94,0:42:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.18,0:42:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that it?
