Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.52,0:44:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 娜蒂  亚曼  - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nandi, Amahle! - Yeah?
