Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.13,0:44:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.99,0:44:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜蒂  我们疏散后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nandi. After we evacuate,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.63,0:44:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我该带你和亚曼  到一个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking that maybe I should take you and Amahle somewhere safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.70,0:44:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有很多事情要做  不能离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so much work to do. I can't leave this place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.97,0:44:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话  我也留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that case, I'm staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.17,0:44:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.01,0:45:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.01,0:45:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.11,0:45:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你们不要互射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, try not to shoot each other, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.62,0:45:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这说不通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.86,0:45:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他无视火把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ignored the thermal flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.86,0:45:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲我们而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Came directly at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.20,0:45:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护巢穴  我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protecting the nest, weren't you? Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.07,0:45:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里有艾巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where there are Ass Blasters,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.64,0:45:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里就有圭布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there are Graboids.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.92,0:45:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我要你将那  能卖钱的玩意给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I'm going to have to take that little money-maker from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.75,0:45:47.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什么  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.19,0:45:50.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赚大钱  把它递过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cashing in, hopefully. Why don't you hand that over?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.29,0:45:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早该知你不怀好意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've known you were dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.16,0:45:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我一生人最幸运的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought it was the luckiest day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.16,0:45:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我派德亚去捉猎豹幼患\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I send Dreyer out to get a cheetah cub,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.03,0:46:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他却遇上一只会飞的食人兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he runs smack-bang into a flying carnivore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.70,0:46:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.87,0:46:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你我不是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's start with who I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.07,0:46:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是南非野生动物部的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not with the South African Wildlife Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.51,0:46:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样做不会有好结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not gonna end good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.94,0:46:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.44,0:46:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活的艾巴比猎豹仔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Ass Blaster would've fetched 100 times
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.41,0:46:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或犀牛角值钱一百倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what a cheetah cub or a rhino horn would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.05,0:46:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死的就不是那么值钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead one, not nearly so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.52,0:46:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是偷猎者  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a common poacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.15,0:46:21.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不介意这称呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morally, I'm okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.19,0:46:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我介意你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.96,0:46:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  爬进笼里  否则我开枪射你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, get into the cage, or I'll shoot you in the stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.10,0:46:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.13,0:46:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.27,0:46:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不会进笼子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you won't cage me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.07,0:46:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't over
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.51,0:46:43.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直至结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.88,0:46:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没用  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.48,0:46:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.29,0:46:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.92,0:46:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.43,0:47:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然的召唤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The call of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.14,0:47:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个世纪以来马赛人  都用尿液作为驱虫剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Maasai have been using urine as an insect repellent for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.42,0:47:29.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可能是毕甘默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This may be the last will and testament
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.69,0:47:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后的遗嘱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Mr. Bertram Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.83,0:47:34.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.73,0:47:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你还在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're still out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.83,0:47:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给HK41找个好的归宿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give the HK 41 a good home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.84,0:47:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.11,0:47:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某程度上  也想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to some extent, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.28,0:47:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仆街云韦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bastard Van Wyk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.99,0:48:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能活着出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I ever get out of here alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.82,0:48:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会放过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.81,0:48:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely an acquired taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.78,0:48:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没结束吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it over yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.52,0:48:33.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.22,0:48:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀掉这见鬼的狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cue the freakin' lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.29,0:48:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听不到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.96,0:48:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个王者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two alphas.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.13,0:48:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同一共识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.83,0:48:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在食物链顶端  一定很孤独\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's lonely on top of the food chain. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.81,0:48:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  天啊  我们要认识彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. We're getting to know one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.81,0:49:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算可以遮阴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shade, at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.86,0:49:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶  不  不  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.30,0:49:20.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  不  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.77,0:49:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无胆鬼  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pussy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.21,0:49:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会打败你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.81,0:49:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我放下了标枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus I give up my spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.65,0:49:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是爬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will claw my way
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.52,0:49:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要爬进你食道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}down your gullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.34,0:49:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你选择冥想的时机不太好  老友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked a weird time to start meditating, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.37,0:50:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在这里做什么  - 我带你回动物园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell you doing here? - I'm taking you back to the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.71,0:50:03.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开进了死亡区  正白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drove straight into a kill zone, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.01,0:50:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你身后有一只圭布  快去高地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a Graboid right behind you. Get to high ground, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.61,0:50:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能有点颠簸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This might get a bit bumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.18,0:50:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on to your frosting.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.36,0:50:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐稳  毕  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Burt!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.89,0:50:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上个停牌没有停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed that last stop sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.03,0:50:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,余下的我走回去好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'll walk the rest of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.50,0:50:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是喜欢户外吗  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to be outdoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.87,0:50:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶你  卓华斯  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you, Travis!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.17,0:50:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非洲滋味如何  毕  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's Africa taste, Burt?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.04,0:50:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  开上岩石  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Get on the rocks. On the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.81,0:50:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开上岩石  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rocks! On the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.12,0:50:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.29,0:50:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我不好  你没事吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My bad. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.64,0:51:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你几乎震断我体内每一根骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You damn near broke every bone in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.11,0:51:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  但我也救了你一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but what does that have to do with me saving your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.31,0:51:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓我看到圭布的行踪  可能是幻觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, I saw Graboid markers. I must be delirious.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.02,0:51:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气  老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome. Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.98,0:51:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你不要这样叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you not to call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.32,0:51:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我在哪  千里眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you know where I was? Remote viewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.09,0:51:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在国家安全局待过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I spent a little time in the NSA.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.59,0:51:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑  你上镜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile, you're on candid camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.00,0:51:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我忘了带你的底裤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I forgot your underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.27,0:51:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被人出卖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.94,0:51:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,云迪  你怎知道  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Van Dick? How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.51,0:51:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他不像是典型的坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew the guy wasn't your typical, run-of-the-mill D-bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.31,0:51:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我暗中对他起底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I did a full, digital cavity search on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.08,0:51:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现他是骗子  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guess what? Poser!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.65,0:51:56.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓的南非野生动物同盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that whole South African Wildlife Federation,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.96,0:51:57.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not even a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.06,0:52:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他得到了一只圭布蛋  打算在黑市出售\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got a Graboid egg, he intends to sell it on the black market,
