Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.72,1:05:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比维先生  我是毕甘默  我遇到一点麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bravers, Burt Gummer here. I'm in a bit of pickle.
