Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.17,1:05:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离一条旧火车桥西北  大概三公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About three clicks northwest of some old railroad bridge, modified for road use.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.67,1:05:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yeah, yeah. I know the spot.
