Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.58,1:05:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有其他办法  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there any other way?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.71,1:05:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在边境战争中  我从一架  米格23上卸下几支火箭炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've got a couple of rocket pods I took off a MiG-23 in the border war.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.45,1:05:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会太夸张  正好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too much? Just right.
