Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.90,1:06:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入一个又深又黑的洞...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to a deep, dark, cavernous...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.61,1:07:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不要再来  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not again!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.78,1:07:53.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是一只丑陋的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one ugly bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.36,1:08:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.88,1:08:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么要报告  我们炸烂了圭布的老巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything to report? Yeah. I think we hit the mother lode.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.38,1:08:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事  巴鲁提  我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening, Baruti? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.22,1:08:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些生物本该在夜间行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, these creatures are supposed to be nocturnal hunters.
