Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.99,1:08:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如非被迫  猎食者不会改变习性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Predators don't change their tactics unless they are forced to do that.
