Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.20,1:08:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为这是原因所在  这里有其他保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think it's that. There are other reserves here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.50,1:08:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那么说  他们冲着我们来  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, they're targeting us. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.40,1:08:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确保所有枪装上子弹  准备好卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure all of our weapons are loaded and the truck is ready.
