Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.57,1:09:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我们行动吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. Let's call it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.90,1:09:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们激怒了领头怪兽  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We pissed off the head worm?
