Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.45,1:10:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查理  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charley?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.23,1:11:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查理  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charley?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.30,1:11:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查理  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charley!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.34,1:11:08.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查理  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charley?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.57,1:12:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a bag of dicks.
