Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.75,1:12:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  亚甘  不要放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Gums. Don't lose faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.61,1:12:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的处境的确很不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are definitely F'ed up beyond all recognition.
