Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.64,1:12:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 噢  天啊  你是对的  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God. You're right. - Yeah.
