Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.56,1:14:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该足够了  会不会滥杀无辜  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna ring their bells. It's a bit of overkill, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.96,1:14:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你要开杀戒  就要杀个片甲不留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're gonna give 'em the horn, give 'em the horn.
