Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.54,1:14:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唏  我喜欢那首歌  拜托  图派在哪  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I like that song. Come on, where's the Tupac?
