Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.92,1:26:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卓华斯  这边  扔过来  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travis, here. Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.40,1:27:06.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没事了  - 你救到她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's okay. It's okay. - You got her, you got her.
