Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.66,1:27:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我有个主意  - 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think I have an idea. - Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.29,1:27:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚曼总是用她的电夹来捉虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amahle always uses her earthworm zapper to catch worms.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.70,1:27:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以做一个大型的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can build one on a much larger scale.
