Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.60,1:27:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.47,1:27:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以利用油田的棍棒  用电线将它们绑起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can use the pile rods from the drill rig and wire them together.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.84,1:27:54.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道打雷闪电的时闲  对不对  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can set your watch to the lightning, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.71,1:27:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  距离现在还有13分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and right now we've got 13 minutes.
