Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.02,1:28:04.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能继续引开她吗  - 我会尽力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you keep her busy? - I can try.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.12,1:28:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们够运的话  他会跟着你的震波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're lucky, she'll follow your seismic signature.
