Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.69,1:28:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的信号  - 我会射火焰箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your signal? - I'll send up a flare.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.18,1:28:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放一点给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me some slack.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.33,1:28:43.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏开始  卓华斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game on, Travis.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.64,1:28:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, tube snake!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.28,1:29:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正过来  天啊  好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. They're headed our way. Goodness, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.28,1:29:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑  跑  跑  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.99,1:29:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  不管你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, wherever you are.
