Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.39,1:31:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了  宝贝  我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over, baby. Come, let's go.
