Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.17,1:32:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.57,1:32:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我知这是非洲  但我不会猎杀的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh. Yeah, no, I know this is Africa, but I'm not gonna eat what I just killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.47,1:32:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Okay.
