Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.47,1:32:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天做得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work today.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.91,1:32:53.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.94,1:32:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.92,1:33:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕氏火车下一站到哪里  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's the next stop on the Burt train?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.82,1:33:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到没人关心的内华达  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More Who-The-Hell-Cares, Nevada?
