Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.53,1:33:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里  我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you goin'? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.40,1:33:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许回佛罗里达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably back to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.20,1:33:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You take care, you hear?
