Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.38,1:34:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我们还要到弗雷斯诺打妖精\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, come on. We got a gremlin to catch in Fresno.
