Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.08,1:34:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(生存者)
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.52,1:34:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(毕甘默与卓华斯韦加)
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.22,1:34:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫毕甘默  我有很多外号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Burt Gummer, and I've been called many things.
