Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.57,1:34:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是卓华斯韦加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm Travis B. Welker.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.47,1:35:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们说我是忍者摄影师  喜欢追求刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been accused of being a ninja photographer, an adrenaline junkie,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.91,1:35:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢勾引22岁妹妹仔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and hitting on hot 22-year-olds.
