Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.58,1:35:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢这些标签  并以它们为生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I embrace these labels, and I live by them.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.08,1:35:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们携手合作  接受离奇  致命  古怪的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And together, we're taking on the bizarre, the deadly, the weird.
