Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.82,1:35:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们解开了生存密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've cracked the code of survival.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.72,1:35:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是所有可怕  古怪  爬行生物的克星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the cure that ails anything crittery, creepy or crawly.
