Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.90,1:35:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the knockout punch to the shadowy world of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.30,1:35:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑  跑  跑  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
