Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.60,1:35:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知你将释放的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what the hell you unleashed in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.60,1:35:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你需要我们帮忙对付  任何在你地板下作怪的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if you need us for anything that goes bang in the night or fluff under your floor...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.27,1:35:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在那边  - 小心背后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's over here! - Watch your back!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.78,1:35:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者只是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or just...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.95,1:35:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...吹号角找我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...reach us on the horn.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.51,1:35:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记着  生存和生命从这里开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember, survival and life starts here.
